\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces The model reads the residual. Three arms run in lockstep with shared noise on 100 GSM8K problems: sampling (top token only), Soft Thinking{} (full blend) and a random-residual control{} (the residual moved to a random token). (a) Share of problems on which each arm has so far picked the same token as sampling at every thinking step. Soft Thinking{} leaves sampling sooner: median step 35.5 vs 66; it leaves first on 59 problems, the random residual on 24, both at once on 17 (sign test $p = 0.0002$). (b) Per problem, how far Soft Thinking{} moves next-token predictions away from sampling's, divided by how far the random residual does (KL divergence, averaged over the steps before either arm leaves sampling; median 31 steps). Soft Thinking{} moves them more on 94 of 100 problems; the median problem is 3.9 times (marker: median and 95\% bootstrap CI over problems, [3.1, 5.0]). Items 50--149, not used in any other experiment; seed 0.\relax }}{11}{figure.caption.27}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:ablation}{{7}{11}{The model reads the residual. Three arms run in lockstep with shared noise on 100 GSM8K problems: sampling (top token only), \ST {} (full blend) and a \ctrl {} (the residual moved to a random token). (a) Share of problems on which each arm has so far picked the same token as sampling at every thinking step. \ST {} leaves sampling sooner: median step 35.5 vs 66; it leaves first on 59 problems, the random residual on 24, both at once on 17 (sign test $p = 0.0002$). (b) Per problem, how far \ST {} moves next-token predictions away from sampling's, divided by how far the random residual does (KL divergence, averaged over the steps before either arm leaves sampling; median 31 steps). \ST {} moves them more on 94 of 100 problems; the median problem is 3.9 times (marker: median and 95\% bootstrap CI over problems, [3.1, 5.0]). Items 50--149, not used in any other experiment; seed 0.\relax }{figure.caption.27}{}}
\newlabel{fig:ablation@cref}{{[figure][7][]7}{[1][9][]11}}
